-- Seed data for local development (`supabase db reset`).
--
-- Intentionally (almost) empty:
--   * public.foods and public.swap_groups are generated by the data pipeline
--     (see pipeline/export); it emits the INSERT/upsert statements or a CSV for
--     `\copy`, with the same ids that are bundled in the app for offline search.
--   * Meal plans are NOT seeded here. They are authored in Excel and uploaded
--     through the in-app admin page (src/lib/plansRepo.ts -> uploadPlans), which
--     assigns version numbers and calls public.publish_plan().
--   * Admin access is granted by hand, once: see supabase/README.md.
